mineral extraction. It does not mention

85
00:07:24,633 --> 00:07:25,336
research.

86
00:07:25,927 --> 00:07:30,950
He read the last line of that panel and laughed —
the second time, and the last.

87
00:07:31,350 --> 00:07:35,710
And then, on the nineteenth pull of the
twentieth ten, the room went black.

88
00:07:37,410 --> 00:07:44,671
Progenitor. Origin. One sealed ampoule. Contents:
the first strain. Not a weapon. Not

89
00:07:44,691 --> 00:07:52,209
a cure. The thing all of it came from. The effect on
the host is permanent, irreversible

90
00:07:52,229 --> 00:08:00,347
and categorical. Requirement: Viral Affinity forty. Your
current Viral Affinity is twenty-four.

91
00:08:00,367 --> 00:08:06,687
Do not open this early. I will not be able to
stop what happens if you do.

92
00:08:07,937 --> 00:08:13,592
The narrator would like you to understand that in four
and a half years, across two hundred

93
00:08:13,612 --> 00:08:18,206
thousand words of panels, that is the first
time the System ever said *I*.

94
00:08:18,726 --> 00:08:21,163
(very cold) Say that again.

95
00:08:21,562 --> 00:08:23,354
Viral Affinity forty.

96
00:08:23,754 --> 00:08:25,324
The last sentence.

97
00:08:26,053 --> 00:08:27,879
Do not open this early.

98
00:08:28,279 --> 00:08:32,849
You said *I will not be able to stop what happens*.
You have never used that word about

99
00:08:32,869 --> 00:08:36,490
