changed and never expanded.

103
00:08:50,485 --> 00:08:56,951
The ampoule went into the sealed vault on level nine
at Arklay — the one Birkin had never

104
00:08:56,971 --> 00:09:02,636
been able to price, the one the drawings had
always shown and never explained.

105
00:09:03,035 --> 00:09:10,032
It went in on the twenty-second of December 2031. It
came out on the fourth of December

106
00:09:10,052 --> 00:09:10,435
