107
00:09:10,836 --> 00:09:13,696
And the other one, quietly, from the
back of the skull.

108
00:09:14,216 --> 00:09:15,389
You will open it.

109
00:09:15,789 --> 00:09:17,915
Of course I will open it.

110
00:09:18,316 --> 00:09:20,120
You do not know what it does.

111
00:09:20,519 --> 00:09:25,992
I know what it *is*. Everything I am, everything in
that cryogenic hall, everything Evelyn

112
00:09:26,012 --> 00:09:31,484
