114
00:09:36,950 --> 00:09:38,420
And if it kills you?

115
00:09:38,820 --> 00:09:42,610
Then it will have been the only worthy
opponent either of us ever met.

116
00:09:43,009 --> 00:09:45,360
He gave Evelyn Marsh the ice.

117
00:09:45,759 --> 00:09:51,928
Fourteen levels, six hundred and eleven staff who
could not disobey her, four thousand

118
00:09:51,948 --> 00:09:58,189
