121
00:10:11,590 --> 00:10:14,840
Find out what a human being is for,
and then improve it.

122
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:20,858
She stood on an airstrip in the interior of
Antarctica in a coat with a crimson iris on

123
00:10:20,878 --> 00:10:26,431
the shoulder and looked at a horizon with nothing on
