129
00:10:43,910 --> 00:10:45,529
Does that trouble you?

130
00:10:45,929 --> 00:10:50,988
And Dr. Evelyn Marsh looked out at
fourteen hundred miles of ice.

131
00:10:51,509 --> 00:10:56,822
It stopped troubling me in about 2029 and I have
been waiting ever since for someone to

132
00:10:56,842 --> 00:10:57,251
